<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the CA Trophy men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 6-4 6-7 (7-9) 6-2 6-3</p>
